  "Starting cards as posted under 'STarting (8)': This Deal Is Getting Worse All The Time ('TDIGWATT/PIDAIAF'), Cloud City: Carbonite Chamber, Prepared Defenses, Secret Plans, All Wrapped Up, I'm Sorry, Allegations Of Corruption and Combat Response; these count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'Secret Plans' dested the Dark Special Edition Effect (deployable by the objective); the post predates Defensive Shields.",
  "Posted 'CC Lower Passages' dested Cloud City: Lower Corridor (Dark): no Cloud City site is titled Lower Passages (Jabba's Palace: Lower Passages is a Jabba's Palace site), and the objective needs a Cloud City battleground site.",
  "Posted 'Bespin', 'Bespin Cloud City', 'Carbonite chamber' and 'Vibro Axe' dested the Dark versions; 'Boba Fett' dested Boba Fett (Cloud City) per earlier DeckTech rulings; 'Iggy W/ Riot Gun' dested IG-88 With Riot Gun; 'Darth Maul (tat)' dested Darth Maul (Tatooine).",
  "Posted 'Captain Gilead Paellion' dested Captain Gilad Pellaeon; 'Baron Soonter Fel' dested Baron Soontir Fel; 'Colnel Jendon' dested Colonel Jendon; 'Omni Box & Its worse' dested Ommni Box & It's Worse; 'Boba Fetts blasters' dested Boba Fett's Blaster Rifle; 'Dengars Riot Gun' dested Dengar's Modified Riot Gun."
